      "content": "thanks. u mentioned \"changes in demographics\" and \"commercial vitality\" - can u elaborate on that? like, are there specific types of shifts in the population or the kinds of businesses that move in/out that are most predictive of a neighborhood losing its stability? i want to make sure our officers know what to look for on the ground.",
